  "R2_clock_buys": {
   "text": "X = T600 / T800 per arm and format, this session's launches only: T600 the mean T of launches whose kernel clock (cycles_max / wall) is in [590, 610] MHz, T800 of those at or above 790 MHz, every kind pooled (at a given clock the kind does not change the count, R4); at least 2 launches at 600 and 5 at 800, else from the fit T = C/f + M over 590-810 MHz, else no verdict. Per ladder arm (c16r32, c16r8, c16r4, c16r2, c16) and c1: PASS if |X - X(M1)| <= 0.03. ORDER: X(c1) > X(c16r32) > X(c16r8) > X(c16r4) > X(c16r2) > X(c16) in fp32: the clock buys less the less a block is reused.",
