   "text": "c4s, the second walk the L3 serves: LIKE THE L3 WALK if |X(c4s) - X(c8s, E119)| <= 0.02, per format, fp32 primary; else NOT LIKE IT, with the difference. Also its share of the way from E119's M1 to M2, (X - X_M1) / (X_M2 - X_M1): OUTSIDE THE CLOCK at <= 0.25, FOLLOWS THE CLOCK at >= 0.75, else PARTIAL (E119's R3, applied to c4s).",
